              "instruction": "lokśāhīt jantā sarkār nivaḍte. — In a democracy, the people choose the government.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *lokśāhīt jantā sarkār nivaḍte.* — In a democracy, the people choose the government.]"
