              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कौल देणे — kaul deṇe — \"to give a mandate; to give a verdict\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लोकांनी तरुण उमेदवाराला कौल दिला. lokānnī taruṇ umedvārālā kaul dilā. The people gave their mandate to the young candidate."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने कौल दिला, tyāne kaul dilā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The one chosen takes -ला: उमेदवाराला कौल देणे (kaul deṇe)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कौल देणे (kaul deṇe) joins कौल, \"a verdict, a word given\", a loan usually traced to Arabic qaul, \"saying, word\", through Persian, to देणे, \"to give\"."
            }
          ]
        },
